      {
        "text": "Plex Media Server before 1.43.3.10861 contains multiple vulnerabilities. In the worst case, a remote attacker could steal a legitimate user's account credentials and eventually write arbitrary files or execute code.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed in Plex Media Server 1.43.3.10861.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
